@req:12575@
Your direct damaging abilities have a $h% chance to trigger the |cFFFFFFFFClearcasting|r effect. 

@ext:This effect cannot occur more than once every 6 seconds.:ext@

Consuming the |cFFFFFFFFClearcasting|r effect triggers a |cFFFFFFFFArcane Burst|r on the target.

|cFFFFFFFFClearcasting|r also gains 1 more charge.
